                                                "sense_id": "45096019-ef6c-32aa-a058-bba159448b6a",
                                                "text": "[W]hen I walk in my fields I can see, down Berwick way, the little fluffs of white smoke which tell me of this strange new hundred-legged beast, with coals for food and a thousand men in its belly, for ever crawling over the border."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
